  "statement": "# Don't Stop — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\nCross a compact town, enter a real combat round, survive hostile pressure, and return to the illuminated exit for a decisive victory.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nA bounded top-down shooter with movement, aiming, firing, native combat, damage and defeat, a complete round, replay, and an explicit victory ending.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\nYou may choose the presentation, encounter dressing, HUD composition, and feedback while preserving the original town, portal, combat, and exit loop.\n"
